<div class="p-AV0pZOXdZR0NpV1FoZ__pango_b_content_VW9hgq p-content scroll-trigger animate--slide-in scroll-trigger--offscreen"><p>QO RACE is the result of obsessive refinement, from the carbon fiber layup to the tooth profiles on each chainring.<br><br>Paired with a 29 mm spindle and a Q-factor optimized for modern road bikes, this carbon crankset delivers the efficiency and control you expect from a high-performance drivetrain. Every detail is tuned to make your ride faster, cleaner, and sharper — whether you're sprinting for the line or attacking the climb.<br></p></div>    

<style>
