<div class="p-AUGhlS0ptQ3lCSU0va__pango_b_content_be37Fc p-content scroll-trigger animate--slide-in scroll-trigger--offscreen"><p>Developed by riders with decades of experience in carbon design and drivetrain optimization, this crankset combines elite road bike performance with real-world durability.<br><br></p><p>From the carbon arms to the shifting ramps geometry shaped by 30+ years of insight, everything is built to deliver long-term speed, reliability, and strength. It’s a road crankset that’s not only light and aerodynamic — it’s built to stay that way, ride after ride.</p></div>    

